PTX LU+add.cluster+dsmem-remote-reader
"Two relaxed .cluster atom.add on one location in the writer's shared memory, read from another CTA of the cluster"
{
x=0 @cta 0;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                      | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0                          ;
 atom.relaxed.cluster.shared::cta.add r0, x, 1 | atom.relaxed.cluster.shared::cluster.add r1, x, 1 ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 0 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
